# the root rotator: SELECT pressed again from Chords; a knob sets a step's root, with SELECT held its bars; with the
# piece, gone with the recipe. Plays, and the header and keys follow. A project from Sparkle's build keeps its settings.
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 9
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 10
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 9
expect par45 0
shot off.png
# the knob starts from the piece's own root, D, and Off is one click back
spin K1 1
expect par45 3
spin K1 -1
expect par45 0
spin K1 3
expect par45 5
spin K2 8
expect par46 10
press SEL
wait 100
shot bars.png
expect par49 3
spin K1 -2
expect par49 1
release SEL
wait 100
expect view 9
wait 5000
shot playing.png
# Setup's Root defers to the Roots page while it has a step
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 7
spin K1 2
expect par19 2
wait 100
shot setup.png
wait 2500
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 100
expect view 9
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par45 5
expect par46 10
expect par49 1
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par45 0
expect par46 0
expect par49 3
storev8 44
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 44
expect par45 0
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 44
